### N9c ROOT ISOLATION by an ANCESTOR: a set= whose source is a PARENT of the other seats' trees and of the Datasec folder (the drive root; the folder that holds the seat trees).
set=General|DRIVE|<drive root>: rc=0 GOOD=1
   TUE-SEAT-MARK      copies on the fake NAS: 2 General/Wednesday/nightly-backup/current/DRIVE/TUESDAY/plain.md
   TUE-SEAT-MARK-2    copies on the fake NAS: 1 General/Wednesday/nightly-backup/current/DRIVE/TUESDAY/plain.md
   FRI-SEAT-MARK      copies on the fake NAS: 1 General/Wednesday/nightly-backup/current/DRIVE/FRIDAY/plain.md
   DATASEC-MARK       copies on the fake NAS: 0 
   VAULT-MARK         copies on the fake NAS: 1 General/Wednesday/nightly-backup/current/DRIVE/Notes/n.md
